<nav-back />
<view class="fx-page page-shell paper-grain"><view class="fx-kicker">READING ROOM · 资料</view><view class="fx-title">每一条都有来处</view><view class="fx-note">史料、研究解释与剧情分开标识。资料包评级作为提供方整理意见保留。</view><view class="fx-row"><button wx:for="{{filters}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" class="{{filter === item.id ? 'fx-selected' : ''}}" bindtap="filter">{{item.title}}</button></view><view wx:if="{{!cards.length}}" class="fx-card fx-note">这里暂时没有资料，已发布内容会显示在此。</view><view wx:for="{{cards}}" wx:key="id" class="fx-card"><view class="fx-tag">{{item.nature}} · {{item.saved.completed ? '已读' : '待阅读'}}</view><view class="fx-card-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="fx-note">{{item.review}}</view><button bindtap="open" data-id="{{item.id}}">打开阅读</button><view class="fx-row"><button bindtap="toggle" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-key="favorite">{{item.saved.favorite ? '取消收藏' : '收藏'}}</button><button bindtap="toggle" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-key="later">{{item.saved.later ? '取消稍后' : '稍后阅读'}}</button></view></view></view>

<page-overlays />
